  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- New analyzer rule FFS0057 prohibits redundant null guards on non-nullable references (#472)\n### Fixed\n- FFS0031 - Cover target-typed new, return types and primary constructors with tests (#509)\n- FFS0011/12/28/29/30/38 - Judge partial types on merged symbol, cover record structs (#510)\n- FFS0041 - Report Console.Out, properties, method groups, using static and aliases (#511)\n- FFS0027/FFS0042/FFS0049 - Cover UnconditionalSuppressMessage and const justifications (#512)\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.342\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.166.2629\n- ProhibitedMethodsDiagnosticsAnalyzer - added tests for several receiver shapes, fixed gaps (#505)\n- FFS0051 - Added tests for Attribute suffix, alias, multiple attributes and generated header (#513)\n- README - Documented that MSBuild-generated InternalsVisibleTo attributes are not reported (#513)",
